          "v": 1,
          "column": 1,
          "fields": {
            "text": "Intuitive Healing Sessions",
            "level": "h2",
            "size": "auto",
            "eyebrow": "iii. Listen · Release · Restore"
          },
          "variant": "plain"
        },
        {
          "id": "blk_nn4f899g8v",
          "type": "text",
          "v": 1,
          "column": 1,
          "fields": {
            "content": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Your feelings are sacred — living teachers, wisdom keepers, and tellers of your stories of the past and present. In your session, we'll delve into the depths of your emotions and the power of your heart, allowing layers of protection to dissolve and initiating profound transformation at cellular, mental, physical, and energetic levels."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "As your heart opens, the inner alchemy begins. I will guide and support you to meet yourself in love. Together, we'll invite the return and integration of soul fragments, facilitating a deep connection with your unique essence and welcoming a greater sense of self-love and freedom."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "These sessions are sacred: a potent container of reclamation to delve into your heart, body, mind, and spirit, and devote your presence to your healing with loving support. I offer them over Zoom, in person in Boulder, or at your home."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "90 minutes · $150 · $175 at your home",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Working together to welcome your wholeness, a session may include:",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "italic"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "variant": "default"
        },
