                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "“In having a session with Courtney I felt like I was working with god, I could feel spirit completely at work. She knew how and where to precisely go in my system. I was able to touch sacred sounds and places within that I have been far away from. I’m so grateful for her light and gifted abilities leading me to a greater sense of awareness, connection, and freedom.”"
