                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "“Working with Courtney was so incredibly powerful it shook me too my core. I was able to reach places I had never gone and express sides of myself that had never been expressed. It was scary and a huge soul retrieval at the same time, retrieving exiled parts of my being. I feel more whole, and at ease with myself since. Courtney has a way with making me feel seen, and heard in some ways for the first time.”"
