          "column": 0,
          "label": "Vocal Alchemy",
          "fields": {
            "text": "Vocal Alchemy",
            "level": "h2",
            "size": "auto",
            "eyebrow": "iv. Breath · Sound · Truth"
          },
          "variant": "plain"
        },
        {
          "id": "blk_arapyz8gyd",
          "type": "text",
          "v": 1,
          "column": 0,
          "fields": {
            "content": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "My Vocal Alchemy sessions are designed to meet you exactly where you are and guide you into the next octave of your expression."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "If you're yearning to feel more comfortable, confident, and free in your authentic expression, these sessions are for you. Together, we unravel the roots of limiting beliefs that may have kept your voice suppressed — whether it's the fear of judgment, the belief that your voice \"isn't good enough,\" or that you \"can't sing.\""
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "These sessions are not about conforming to a standard, but about discovering and embracing the beauty of your unique sound and its healing powers. I weave a variety of practices to support your liberation — cathartic release, vocal play, sounding techniques, and inner child healing — and you'll walk away with a personalized toolkit that empowers your voice and authentic expression."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "90 minutes · $150 · $175 at your home",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "If you are ready to…",
                      "marks": [
