      "blocks": [
        {
          "id": "blk_cqs1s1kpm2",
          "type": "text",
          "v": 1,
          "column": 0,
          "fields": {
            "content": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "blockquote",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "“Courtney is clear conduit for the divine, a role model for what can be done with voice and play. The session I had with her was more powerful than any DMT journeys I'v ever been on. She met me right where I was and used the energy to move through ancient wounds and trauma. I felt completely safe to move through whatever I needed too even if it was really ugly, there was no judgment. The amount of work we did in this short time was astounding. My entire being was flooded with light and transmutation. I feel empty, whole, healed.”"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Bonnie",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " · "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Vocal Alchemy session",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "italic"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "blk_8fhcrxp1np",
          "type": "text",
          "v": 1,
          "column": 1,
          "fields": {
            "content": {
              "type": "doc",
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "blockquote",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "paragraph",
                      "content": [
                        {
                          "type": "text",
                          "text": "“Courtney Acamo is an angel and one of the most pure hearts I’ve ever met. She is the embodiment of everything she teaches and her presence alone is deeply healing and activating. She helped me dissolve one of the biggest subconscious fears I’ve had my entire life, which is the fear of singing. After a life-time of believing that “I have the worst voice in the world” and never allowing myself the joy and pleasure of singing, Courtney has helped me realize that the voice, just like everything else, is not fixed. It can be developed & refined over time, with practice & patience, just like any other instrument. Beyond the singing, however, at a much deeper level, Courtney has supported me in believing that my voice (not just my singing voice, but my voice in general) is worthy of being heard. This has been deeply healing, liberating, and empowering on so many levels and I can already feel the impact it is already having on all other areas of my life. Eternally grateful.”"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Stephano",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "bold"
                        }
                      ]
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": " · "
                    },
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Vocal Alchemy session",
                      "marks": [
                        {
                          "type": "italic"
                        }
                      ]
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          }
        }
      ]
